						<p class="pTitle">Revixi is Recruiting </p>
							<p class=pText>
							Revixi is currently looking for new members.  Please visit www.Revixi.net for more info or email me at silva_dragon04@yahoo.com. Thank you.
							<br>
							 - Mongoay<BR><BR>
