						<p class="pTitle">New recruitment standards </p>
							<p class=pText>
							After becoming 1 of the largest 40+ guilds on the server in order move forward sistinas had increased its minimum level requirement to 50+ and invitations are strictly by application.We are now beginning to Sol-ro Tower flag. If you can raid Friday/Saturday nights and can play atleast 20 hours a week please apply at our website by clicking the sistinas name in the guilds section.<BR><BR>Wizards High need<BR>Mages High need<BR>Clerics need<BR>Druids Low need<BR>Beastlord Low need<BR>Enchanter need<BR>paladin need<BR>Warrior low need<BR>SK need<BR>Necromancer Need<BR><BR><BR>Exarch Yates Arcanfore<BR>65th level cleric<BR>Guild leader Sistinas
							<br>
							 - sistinas<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
					
						<p class="pDate">Saturday, March 20, 2004</p>
						<p class="pTitle">Ringwar 03/27 </p>
							<p class=pText>
							Greetings to you all:<br><br>Although today's Ringwar failed, we were so VERY VERY close to Nirandi.  <br><br>In light of that I plan on doing another Ringwar on 03/27 at NOON EST so noone has to wake up horribly early and wont interfere with most guild raids.  Tell your guildies, your friends, everyone who is powerful enough (55 or so) to attend and we'll ace this easy.  I hope many of you will choose to attend.  <br><br>Thank you.  
							<br>
							 - Kerocene/Oluran<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
<center>
<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
</center>
					

						<p class="pTitle">Knights of Nobility Accepting New Members! </p>
							<p class=pText>
							Knights of Nobility Seeking New Members<BR><BR>Knights of Nobility Accepting New Members<BR><BR>Knights of Nobility Accepting New Members<BR><BR>As the winds of chaos died, only a few remained to stand strong against the darkness. They were deemed the Knights of Nobility by Mithaniel Marr himself.<BR><BR>Knights of Nobility seeks to shed light upon the inhabitants of Norrath and its heavens by banding together to facilitate hunting parties, protect each other from evil forces, and share our wealth of knowledge with each other.<BR><BR>If you are seeking a guild that is more interested in adventuring and exploring than being "uber", that doesn't require you to play a certain number of hours a week, likes to do a bit of roleplaying (nothing too strict), and that brings together like-minded players that enjoy all facets of the game (not just leveling), then we may be the guild for you!<BR><BR>Check out our website by clicking on the "Guilds" link on the left and make yourself known to us in our message forum!<BR><BR>Honor virutus preamium!<BR>Honor is the reward of virtue!<BR><BR>Sincerely,<BR>Tuwini Tooteeny<BR>Grand Duchess<BR>Knights of Nobility 
							<br>
							 - Tuwini<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
					
						<p class="pDate">Friday, March 19, 2004</p>
						<p class="pTitle">ESPN Fantasy Baseball League </p>
							<p class=pText>
							If you are interested in competing against fellow  players outside of EQ, consider participating in an ESPN Fantasy Baseball league for players on Sol Ro. We have done these leagues in the past and its usually a good time for all involved. If you are interested, please let me know as soon as possible and I will PM you the password to get into the league. You can reach me via PM at http://www.bloodofro.com<br><br>More info can be found at: http://games.espn.go.com/cgi/flb/frontpage <br><br>For those that are going to participate, please sign up for a team at: <br><br>https://r.espn.go.com/espn/purchase?productOfferId=FLB2004&offerOptionId=FLB2004OneTeam&CMP=ILC-PP1193697008 <br><br>Once you have purchased your team, click on this link: http://games.espn.go.com/cgi/flb/request.dll?GROUPFIND <br><br>Information for the league is: <br><br>League: Sol Ro <br>Draft Type: Live <br>Draft Date: Friday, April 2. 9:00 PM (PT) <br>League Access: Private <br>Password: [SEND PM FOR PW] <br>Uber Activity Level: Allstar <br>Scoring Type: Rotisserie <br>Stat Set Type: 5x5 <br>Universe Type: ML <br><br>First 10 teams will make up the league. If we are short, we will open it to friends/family of those already signed up.<br> <br>
							<br>
							 - Spioctor<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
<center>
<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
</center>
					

