						<p class="pTitle">Calling all Adventurers </p>
							<p class=pText>
							Recruitment <BR> <BR>Death Misdealt, top 18 Sol Ro guild is looking for a few good toons. If you value integrity, adventure, friendship, humor and working on common goals we may be a place for you. DM is actively recruiting 55+ characters who can raid 2-3 times a week. DM is growing and reaching for higher and higher mobs while supporting the growth of its individual members. To learn more about us, visit the website at deathmisdealt.org or contact me in game.<BR><BR>Alanalu<BR>Recruitment Officer <BR>Death Misdealt<BR><BR> <BR>
							<br>
							 - Alanalu<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
					
						<p class="pDate">Sunday, March 14, 2004</p>
						<p class="pTitle">Ringwar on 03/20 </p>
							<p class=pText>
							Let it be known a Ring War of epic scale will be taking place on Saturday at NOON EST.  We MUST defend Thurgadin against the scourge that is the giant menace they face.  Adventurers of the 55th season or higher are welcome to attend and all loot will be rolled upon on a nbg basis.  Come, be amongst friends, slaughter giants, and be merry.  Good luck on your rolls and Godspeed!
							<br>
							 - Kerocene<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
