							To Whom it may concern,<br><BR><BR><br><br>I Talic Mightyheart would like to announce my upcomming wedding to the kind and beautiful Bard Fauve. The wedding will be on Sunday the 7th of Nov. at 9pm PST in the East Commons on top of the mountain near the Nek. Forrest zone, LOC 900,-733.<br>We wish this to be a sever event and all to come that can. After the wedding we will be having a help fest in, providing buffs, food, drink, heals, and summoned items of all kinds to all who might be in need. Thanks!<br><BR><BR><br>Talic Mightyheart(The luckiest Gnome in all Norath)<br> <br><br>
