							<p class=pText>
							This in from Atlus:<BR><BR><br><br>Kane Bayle, many years ago killed my father.<br>My father was a personal guard to Antonius Bayle, ruler of Antonica.<br>When it was discovered that Kane Bayle was going to have his brother assassinated, my father raced to his stop him.<br>My father died that day...giving his life for Antonius Bayle.<br>I send out a call now...Kane Bayle nears completetion of his final task...<br>All whom have killed the dragons and been in Fear, I send a call to you...a challenge...<br>help slay this vile man, help me revenge my parents.<BR><BR>Atlus<BR><BR><br><br>
							<br>
							 - Aanamdar<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
