						<p class="pTitle">Holloween Event </p>
							<p class=pText>
							Upcoming Event by Bane:<BR><BR>The Grim Legion in accordance with www.siliconmage.com and Company shall be performing a "halloween" RP this season in celebration of our coming. Our intentions with this RP is to help promote the server message boards and the spirit of role playing. Its that time of year again for haunted manors, ghosts, goblins, vampires, werewolves, and all those things that go bump in the night. This shall be an interactive role play where those involved will try to decipher the outcome of the RP to win the prize, which shall be to hold a slave for the alloted time period of four hours of game time. The slave shall be announced. We are currently seeking extra "villains" to complete the cast and round it out.<BR><BR> <BR>When you see posts in the general message forum and in the RP forum on www.siliconmage.com by the "GL KeepCaretaker" you will be able to reply via private messages to the "GL KeepCaretaker" and he shall tell you what happens next as you respond to what happens. The only rules are that when you recive a response from the GL KeepCaretaker you must take the information passed on to you and relay it to a post in the RP message forum on Silicon Mage that the storyline may evolve. Keep watching...and remember...if you feel your being watched...that means you are Muhahahahahaha.... <BR><BR><BR><BR>For any further information please send all private messages to Banegrivm at www.siliconmage.com via the private message service therein. <BR><BR><BR><BR>Sir Banegrivm Blackheart<BR><BR>Black Knight of Norrath<BR><BR>Paladin of Valour<BR><BR>Grand Master of the Grim Legion<BR> <BR><BR>
							<br>
							 - Aanamdar<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
					
