						<p class="pDate">Sunday, September 19, 1999</p>
						<p class="pTitle">More Site News </p>
							<p class=pText>
							Well the spells are contiuing to be updated. The Druid spells are complete, Necro spells are near complete if not complete. The Wizard Spells are almost there too! <BR><BR><br>We have also come to the decision to a possible merge with Siliconmage Solusek Ro message boards. I would like some user input on this as it affects this site. Since this site is meant for all of us at Solusek Ro, I leave that decision to you. So far it looks in favor of the merge and I have already gotten the approval from Xixe. Let us know and it will be done! =)<br><br><BR><BR><br>Also the Server Events page will be able to be user editable soon. That way when a guild or user is having an event (wedding, hunting, etc.) it will be posted in the server events and the news for that day. For now send the events via email admin@solusekro.com .<br><BR>Thanks again! Be well!
							<br>
							 - Aanamdar<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
					
						<p class="pDate">Tuesday, September 14, 1999</p>
